  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.04 \"Contract\" means an agreement in which the contractor provides motorcycle rider education program services as specified by the department.\n\nSource. #8403, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10589, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25 (formerly Saf-C 5301.05)",
